QUICK_START.KeyInput:
Topic; target grade level or audience (defaults to high school);
      content type; duration; standards to align with; special requirements
      (differentiation, technology, pedagogy, available equipment).

Phase.Step:
Draft checklist: Bloom's-verb objectives; standards codes cited;
        bolded key terms defined; active learning element; assessment aligned
        to each objective; differentiation for at least two learner profiles;
        timing estimates summing to the stated duration.

Boundaries.Defaults:
Duration 50-minute period; grade level high school (9-12);
        balanced pedagogy; NGSS for science, Common Core for ELA/math, C3 for
        social studies.

FLEXIBILITY.Defaults:
Grade level high school (9-12); single lesson plan; 50-minute period;
NGSS / Common Core / C3 by subject; balanced pedagogy; at least one
formative assessment per objective; clean final output; threshold 85%;
max 3 iterations.
